From: N-D draft <draft@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:35:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] N-D contract: close agreed gaps before E6

- C9: resolution authority adds the engine single-candidate rule (auditable, reversible)
- C9a: a bucket's model_belief is a hint, never a resolution
- C12: local (interpreter) and global (engine, backward + forward) ambiguity runs
- LLM contract: required entity type; dimension dictionary; stateless per-event sessions
- ND-1/gold/README.md: reference-only status and how to read buckets
- MH3 references C9a
---
